<figure id="alg6" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 6</span> </span> VLM-Guided Artifact Correction Loop</figcaption>
